---
// Forty out-of-sample months of one model's rank IC (the cross-sectional Spearman
// correlation between score and next-month return, one number per month).
// Simulated panel (python, seed 80): forest of 200 trees, depth 4, trained on the
// first 80 months, scored on the last 40. mean 0.055, sd 0.076, t = 0.055 / (0.076 / sqrt(40)) = 4.6,
// 33 of 40 months positive.
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';
const W = 900;
const H = 380;
const ics: number[] = [0.0605, 0.1021, 0.1077, 0.1286, 0.0787, 0.0057, 0.1651, 0.0151, 0.0595, 0.0226, 0.0082, 0.0623, 0.0389, 0.1606, 0.0921, 0.1615, 0.0836, -0.0527, 0.064, 0.13, 0.1009, 0.2279, -0.1002, 0.0894, 0.0432, 0.1415, -0.0328, -0.0531, 0.0752, 0.0516, 0.024, 0.0555, 0.0513, -0.0993, 0.0966, 0.0175, -0.066, 0.1432, -0.0636, 0.0072];
const X0 = 60, PW = 800, PY = 80, PH = 220;
const ZY = PY + PH / 2;
const sc = (PH / 2) / 0.25;     // px per 1.0 of IC; axis shows +-0.25
const BW = PW / ics.length;
const mean = 0.055;
---
<figure class="atp08-ic">
  <div class="atp08-ic-scroll">
    <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Forty monthly bars of out-of-sample rank IC for one simulated model. Most bars are above zero, seven are below, and the average is 0.055, drawn as a dashed line. The monthly standard deviation is 0.076, and the t-statistic of the mean is 4.6.">
      <DiagramIcon name="chart" x={22} y={22} size={22} />
      <text x="44" y="28" class="h">
        <tspan data-lang-en>A good ranking still loses some months</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Một mô hình xếp hạng tốt vẫn thua vài tháng</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="20" y="52" class="sub">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Rank IC per out-of-sample month, one simulated model</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Rank IC mỗi tháng ngoài mẫu, một mô hình mô phỏng</tspan>
      </text>
      <rect x={X0} y={PY} width={PW} height={PH} rx="6" class="panel" />
      <line x1={X0} y1={ZY} x2={X0 + PW} y2={ZY} class="axis" />
      {ics.map((v, i) => (
        <rect x={X0 + i * BW + 2} y={v >= 0 ? ZY - v * sc : ZY} width={BW - 4} height={Math.max(1, Math.abs(v) * sc)} rx="1.5" class={`bar ${v >= 0 ? 'up' : 'dn'}`} />
      ))}
      <line x1={X0} y1={ZY - mean * sc} x2={X0 + PW} y2={ZY - mean * sc} class="mean" />
      <text x={X0 + PW} y={PY - 8} text-anchor="end" class="stat">
        <tspan data-lang-en>dashed line: mean 0.055</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>đường đứt: trung bình 0,055</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x={X0 - 8} y={ZY + 4} text-anchor="end" class="tick">0</text>
      <text x={X0 - 8} y={PY + 12} text-anchor="end" class="tick">+0.25</text>
      <text x={X0 - 8} y={PY + PH - 2} text-anchor="end" class="tick">−0.25</text>
      <text x={X0} y={PY + PH + 22} class="tick">
        <tspan data-lang-en>month 1 of the test period</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>tháng 1 của giai đoạn test</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x={X0 + PW} y={PY + PH + 22} text-anchor="end" class="tick">
        <tspan data-lang-en>month 40</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>tháng 40</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="20" y="350" class="stat">
        <tspan data-lang-en>33 of 40 months positive · standard deviation 0.076 · t = 0.055 ÷ (0.076 ÷ √40) = 4.6</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>33 trên 40 tháng dương · độ lệch chuẩn 0,076 · t = 0,055 ÷ (0,076 ÷ √40) = 4,6</tspan>
      </text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Simulated (python, seed 80). A mean IC of 0.055 sounds tiny, but it is consistent: the Statistics post's question, how many standard errors from zero, is answered here by t = 4.6. The seven red months are the price of admission.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Mô phỏng (python, seed 80). IC trung bình 0,055 nghe nhỏ xíu, nhưng nó đều đặn: câu hỏi của bài Thống kê, cách số 0 bao nhiêu sai số chuẩn, được trả lời ở đây bằng t = 4,6. Bảy tháng đỏ là cái giá phải trả.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .atp08-ic { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .atp08-ic-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .atp08-ic svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .atp08-ic text { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .atp08-ic .h { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .atp08-ic .sub { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .atp08-ic .tick { font-size: 12px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .atp08-ic .stat { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .atp08-ic .panel { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .atp08-ic .axis { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .atp08-ic .bar.up { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold-icon); stroke-width: 1; }
  .atp08-ic .bar.dn { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .atp08-ic .mean { stroke: var(--text); stroke-width: 1.6; stroke-dasharray: 6 4; }
  .atp08-ic figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
